4-7 charges per scroll, average 5.5.  Magic markers start with 30-99 
charges, average 64.5.  The scroll of charging costs 8-15 charges, 
average 11.5.  If you could use every charge in a marker efficiently, 
you'd average 18.7 scrolls of magic mapping per marker.  But you can't 
use every marker efficiently, so round that down to 18.

The big downside is that you'll need 20 surplus blank scrolls... some 
games that will be easy, and other games it will be impossible. 

